# Cloudflare Pages redirects.
# URL-preservation strategy: live URLs are kept 1:1 wherever possible.
# Exceptions handled here:

# /T&C contains an ampersand (bad URL practice); normalize to /terms (301 keeps SEO equity).
/T&C   /terms   301
/T%26C /terms   301

# Junk/duplicate blog slugs → canonical (added during the blog phase):
# /blog/7-best-chrome-bookmark-extensions-in-2026-(tested-ranked)-copy  /blog/<canonical>  301
# /blog/7-best-chrome-bookmark-extensions-2026-tested-ranked            /blog/<canonical>  301
